      "MP70X2"
    ],
    "description": "Zebra Technologies MP70X1 & MP70X2 scanner scales: a family of self-indicating, weight-only, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments, suitable for direct sales to the public. Designed for flush-mounting in checkout surface with frame extensions to support the instrument in the checkout counter; steel framework supporting one load cell, barcode scanner and electronics; stainless steel load receptor; single or dual pole-mounted display; optional Produce Flip-Up Bar Platter and optional Customer Side Scanner (CSS). Designed for permanent installation in checkout surface, therefore no level indicator required (levelled at installation; medium size model may be fitted with adjustable feet). In the type designations 'X' denotes alternative approved models, variables not affecting metrological parameters. Remote pole displays may be replaced by alternative 'Primary Weight Indication' on an approved EPOS customer/operator display."
